otecting-police-dogs-etc-from-unnecessary-suffering"><em>Protecting police dogs etc. from unnecessary suffering</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/3">3.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/3">Harming a service animal</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/part/1/crossheading/animal-welfare-offences-disqualification-orders"><em>Animal welfare offences: disqualification orders</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/4">Disqualification orders</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/5">Disqualification orders: further provision</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/part/1/crossheading/animal-health-offences-penalties"><em>Animal health offences: penalties</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/6">Fixed penalty notices for offences relating to animal health</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/part/1/crossheading/wildlife-offences-penalties"><em>Wildlife offences: penalties</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/7">Wildlife and Countryside Act 1981: penalties for offences</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/8">Protection of Badgers Act 1992: penalties for offences</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/9">9.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/9">Conservation (Natural Habitats, etc.) Regulations 1994: penalties for offences</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/10">10.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/10">Deer (Scotland) Act 1996: penalties for offences</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/11">11.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/11">Wild Mammals (Protection) Act 1996: penalties for offences</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/12">12.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/12">Protection of Wild Mammals (Scotland) Act 2002: penalties for offences</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/13">13.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2020/14/section/13">Fixed penalty notices for certain wildlife offences</a></span></p></li></ol></li><